{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36225","headline":"陪胡中丞泛湖 · 方干","name":"陪胡中丞泛湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙舟仙药醉行春，上界稀逢下界人。\n绮绣峰前闻野鹤，旌旗影里见游鳞。\n澄潭彻底齐心镜，杂树含芳让锦茵。\n凡许从容谁不幸，就中光显是州民。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36225.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36225","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}